{"occurrence_id": "gissing-the-odd-women-2e4d27a5f034c6dc", "work_id": "gissing-the-odd-women", "language": "en", "canonical_sha256": "8b092fbf41dbb93d6282ff84fd73c0ef356dbe45291901fc5bfef56ea93a7a07", "pattern_version": "0.11", "pattern_id": "en_present", "match": "I\nlove you", "start": 173679, "end": 173689, "context_start": 173543, "context_end": 173909, "context": "“Thank you for saying that—for putting it so well, and so kindly for\nme. Let us disregard people, then. Let us go on seeing each other. I\nlove you with all my soul”—he choked a little at this first utterance\nof the solemn word—“and your rules shall be mine. Give me a chance of\nwinning you. Tell me if I offend you in anything—if there’s anything\nyou dislike in me.”", "candidate_status": "candidate", "extraction_tool_version": "1.0", "form_family": "present", "polarity": "affirmative", "tense_aspect": "present", "temporal_modifier": "optional", "syntactic_family": "main_or_embedded"}
{"occurrence_id": "gissing-the-odd-women-4d7aa3e46d5e0813", "work_id": "gissing-the-odd-women", "language": "en", "canonical_sha256": "8b092fbf41dbb93d6282ff84fd73c0ef356dbe45291901fc5bfef56ea93a7a07", "pattern_version": "0.11", "pattern_id": "en_present", "match": "I love you", "start": 249929, "end": 249939, "context_start": 249439, "context_end": 250078, "context": "“MY DEAREST MONICA,”—the missive began—“Why have you not written\nbefore this? I have been dreadfully uneasy ever since receiving your\nlast letter. Your headache soon went away, I hope? Why haven’t you made\nanother appointment? It is all I can do to keep from breaking my\npromise and coming to ask about you. Write at once, I implore you, my\ndearest. It’s no use telling me that I must not use these words of\naffection; they come to my lips and to my pen irresistibly. You know so\nwell that I love you with all my heart and soul; I can’t address you\nlike I did when we first corresponded. My darling! My dear, sweet,\nbeautiful little girl—”", "candidate_status": "candidate", "extraction_tool_version": "1.0", "form_family": "present", "polarity": "affirmative", "tense_aspect": "present", "temporal_modifier": "optional", "syntactic_family": "main_or_embedded"}
